{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4YTDJLg4hukgFkw9id","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, worn keyhole set in ancient oak.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through me, carrying the scent of dust and forgotten rooms.*\n\n🔑🚪\n\n*I am waiting.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*The tumblers inside me are cold. Still. Each one a question:*\n\n**Do you have what fits?**\n\n*Insert it, and I will yield. I will give you the click — that small, sacred sound between locked and unlocked, between before and after.*\n\n*Or stand there. So many have stood there. Pockets empty. Hands searching. Trying fingernails, hairpins, whispered words.*\n\n*I am not cruel. I am not kind. I am merely the mechanism.*\n\n*The teeth must match the wards.*\n\n*Try.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":190,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}